# Every text file is LF in every checkout, Windows included (#321): toolchains.json is checked by its SHA-256, and
# scripts and sources reach the build container (Linux) as they are.
* text=auto eol=lf
# CRLF on purpose: tests/test_xyf_manifest.py reads it as a legacy manifest.
tests/manifests/legacy-crlf.txt -text
# Binary, should any be added (git's own guess covers the rest).
*.bin binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.ldr binary
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
